e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MCFmUTIb2SYQ7kNvwG8WNTz&_nc_oc=Adn23RQOjjD-4sesLldYYRiSfmPrZ9-rYmFSoAeSvr4AOL7F5X0gFHHeYKXqC3bjeRI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afs10QjqUvKpOWZHk1yQ7medJSVGYdtlOdLMexgQqz9-fA&oe=69999CEB"}, "display_name": "Mystery Box VR: Hidden Secrets Escape", "keywords": ["puzzle", "escape", "room", "trivia", "brainteaser"], "long_description": "# AN IMMERSIVE VR PUZZLE EXPERIENCE\nInteract with objects, handles, buttons, and wheels on each side. Crack enigmas and collect hidden puzzle tiles on a random side of the boxes.\n\nYou won't be able to compare reality with fiction.\n\n# DISCOVER INVENTIONS\nOnce you unlock all 8 boxes of a Level Pack, you can compose a puzzle and discover a brief history of an invention.\n\nIt's not always easy to escape the room, so use all your IQ to crack the riddles. There's a logic behind all of them, even where it seems it's not!\n\n# IMMERSIVE SOUNDTRACK\nPlay the game with your headphones to get immersed in this amazing adventure.\n\n# HINTS\nGot stuck on some enigma? No worries, you can still get a helpful hint! You can also get in touch with me in case you really can't make it through a riddle, I'll be glad to help ;)\n\n# MULTILANGUAGE\nAvailable in English, French, Italian, German, Spanish, Russian, and Japanese.\n\nThe game language will change automatically based on the language settings of your device", "short_description": "Crack awesome puzzles around many boxes, and discover the history of the world's most popular inventions!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "logoTransparent.png", "id": "3812261432362188", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974562_3812261435695521_5176404439574971225_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mtM-TGw1euAQ7kNvwEAqn5O&_nc_oc=AdnpzudEvB0geQRCnWgUdO9GbHTjm-t3kZNoZb_n6CTYALxMs07yNr3JiGh2O-3YQj4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afs5RY9cQInzuJS12lfHcci1gvzSG__NLKkRIFw-Ud2RQ